			"size": {
				"x": 900.0,
				"y": 166.0
			},
			"text": "The car wagon's own picture: the side, front, top and rear views of its reference sheet (tools/vehicle-assets/car-wagon/sheet.png), packed by tools/vehicle-assets/build.py, which also lays its model's faces on them. Alpha is clear where the sheet is background: railings, ladders and ropes are cut out of it. Colour artwork from sources/artwork.png, 512 px, from an ImageGen study. Pigment adjusts hue, saturation and value; the defaults keep the artwork as it is. The ...PNG8 groups and the nodes after them only store exact file values; leave them. Export: File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/vehicles, then Reload assets in the game's Tuning panel.",
			"title": "About this material",
			"type": "comment"
		},
